{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05624","headline":"和登会稽山 · 孙逖","name":"和登会稽山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"稽山碧湖上，势入东溟尽。\n烟景昼清明，九峰争隐嶙。\n望中厌朱绂，俗内探玄牝。\n野老听鸣驺，山童拥行轸。\n仙花寒未落，古蔓柔堪引。\n竹磵入山多，松崖向天近。\n云从海天去，日就江村陨。\n能赋丘尝闻，和歌参不敏。\n冥搜信冲漠，多士期标准。\n愿奉濯缨心，长谣反招隐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}